{"id":"d8e8ee1bf3b6a587","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order.md","title":"ZFC PCF Reduced Product Order","display":"df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order — ZFC PCF Reduced Product Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order — ZFC PCF Reduced Product Order","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order — ZFC PCF Reduced Product Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\vec\\lambda,F,f,g\\in V\">\\(I,\\vec\\lambda,F,f,g\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfReducedProductOrder}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcfReducedProductOrder}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}product\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfReducedProductOrder}_S(f,g,I,F,\\vec\\lambda)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\lambda))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\lambda(i))\\land\\vec\\lambda(i)\\neq0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\n\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec\\lambda(i)\n\\land\\{i\\in I\\mid f(i)\\leq g(i)\\}\\in F.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}product\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfReducedProductOrder}_S(f,g,I,F,\\vec\\lambda)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\lambda))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\lambda(i))\\land\\vec\\lambda(i)\\neq0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\n\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec\\lambda(i)\n\\land\\{i\\in I\\mid f(i)\\leq g(i)\\}\\in F.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is not used as a set-valued function codomain; ordinal typing is imposed pointwise.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\vec\\lambda,F,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfReducedProductOrder}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}product\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfReducedProductOrder}_S(f,g,I,F,\\vec\\lambda)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\lambda))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\vec\\lambda(i))\\land\\vec\\lambda(i)\\neq0\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\n\\land f,g\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\vec\\lambda(i)\n\\land\\{i\\in I\\mid f(i)\\leq g(i)\\}\\in F.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false}],"bytes":1486,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3033","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order.md|58-df-zfc-pcf-reduced-product-order]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","5a7d94a7a7f8209a"]}